1
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:43,280
<font color="#ffffff">How did you manipulate my man?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

2
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:46,160
<font color="#ffffff">Why did Captain Chansuek team up with you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

3
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,880
<font color="#ffffff">to steal that seized diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

4
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:50,720
<font color="#ffffff">You quickly jumped to the conclusion</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

5
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:53,240
<font color="#ffffff">that Captain Chansuek stole it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

6
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:55,520
<font color="#ffffff">Once you capture them,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

7
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:57,960
<font color="#ffffff">hand Chansuek over to me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

8
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,440
<font color="#ffffff">He's the only one I want.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

9
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:03,320
<font color="#ffffff">I can give you anything for that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

10
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:06,800
<font color="#ffffff">Officers! I'm Thai!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

11
00:03:06,880 --> 00:03:08,080
<font color="#ffffff">I'm Thai too, sir!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

12
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:09,720
<font color="#ffffff">Where is Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

13
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,920
<font color="#ffffff">How is he?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

14
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:16,560
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea was taken</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">by the police for questioning.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

15
00:03:16,640 --> 00:03:19,600
<font color="#ffffff">Won't you at least tell me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">why I'm being taken?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

16
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:24,000
<font color="#ffffff">PREVIOUSLY</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

17
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,960
<font color="#ffffff">How can you be so sure</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

18
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:31,120
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod is Captain Chansuek?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

19
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:33,280
<font color="#ffffff">The police told me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

20
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:36,120
<font color="#ffffff">Then you should know that</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

21
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:39,240
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod isn't a thief.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

22
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:42,880
<font color="#ffffff">He's just a cop doing his job.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

23
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:44,920
<font color="#ffffff">If he's not a thief,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

24
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:48,160
<font color="#ffffff">why hasn't he returned it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

25
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:50,600
<font color="#ffffff">Are you even sure the diamond</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

26
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:52,960
<font color="#ffffff">is with him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

27
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:57,400
<font color="#ffffff">What do you mean by that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

28
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:04,520
<font color="#ffffff">I've already informed the police</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

29
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:08,480
<font color="#ffffff">that as of now…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

30
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:10,280
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod has no memory of anything.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

31
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:14,720
<font color="#ffffff">If you ask him about the diamond,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">he honestly has no idea.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

32
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:18,040
<font color="#ffffff">Didn't the police tell you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

33
00:04:20,440 --> 00:04:22,360
<font color="#ffffff">Do you honestly think</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

34
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:24,480
<font color="#ffffff">saying that would make me</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

35
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:26,880
<font color="#ffffff">believe you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

36
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:30,640
<font color="#ffffff">If so,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

37
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,840
<font color="#ffffff">I have no way to convince you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

38
00:04:32,920 --> 00:04:34,760
<font color="#ffffff">How much money do you want?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

39
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,960
<font color="#ffffff">Just tell me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

40
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:40,520
<font color="#ffffff">Love doesn't need money.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

41
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,800
<font color="#ffffff">How about a million?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

42
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:46,240
<font color="#ffffff">Two million?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

43
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,560
<font color="#ffffff">Please…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

44
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:51,840
<font color="#ffffff">Calm yourself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

45
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:54,320
<font color="#ffffff">I believe…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

46
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:59,360
<font color="#ffffff">the diamond will return to its owner.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

47
00:04:59,960 --> 00:05:01,800
<font color="#ffffff">Just wait</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

48
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:05,520
<font color="#ffffff">until Boonrod's memory comes back.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

49
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:07,880
<font color="#ffffff">I am certain</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

50
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:11,080
<font color="#ffffff">he will bring the diamond back to you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

51
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:15,960
<font color="#ffffff">Then until that Boonrod of yours</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

52
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:18,480
<font color="#ffffff">brings my diamond back…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

53
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,920
<font color="#ffffff">I'm afraid I must ask you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

54
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:24,760
<font color="#ffffff">to stay right here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

55
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:41,400
<font color="#ffffff">Keep a close eye on him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

56
00:05:45,200 --> 00:05:48,920
<font color="#ffffff">Two million baht!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">You're going to be rich, Luang Pho.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

57
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:52,200
<font color="#ffffff">What are you doing here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

58
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:57,840
<font color="#ffffff">Having too much money</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">only breeds greed and desire.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

59
00:05:58,440 --> 00:06:00,200
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Sadhu.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

60
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:14,360
<font color="#ffffff">Was Luang Pho Suea really taken?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

61
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:16,560
<font color="#ffffff">Obviously.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

62
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:21,000
<font color="#ffffff">Do you know who they are?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

63
00:06:23,640 --> 00:06:25,920
<font color="#ffffff">And why should we tell you any of this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

64
00:06:27,280 --> 00:06:29,520
<font color="#ffffff">So we can team up and find Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

65
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:36,280
<font color="#ffffff">We think it was the cops</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">who took Luang Pho to Kamnan Sawaeng.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

66
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,280
<font color="#ffffff">Cops?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

67
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:43,000
<font color="#ffffff">You guys wait here for a bit.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

68
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:45,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'll go look into this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

69
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:46,520
<font color="#ffffff">Wait.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

70
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:51,000
<font color="#ffffff">How do we know that</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

71
00:06:51,080 --> 00:06:53,320
<font color="#ffffff">you won't bring</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the cops back to arrest us?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

72
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,520
<font color="#ffffff">You guys don't trust me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

73
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,760
<font color="#ffffff">We only just met today.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

74
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:02,480
<font color="#ffffff">It just feels weird to team up with you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

75
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:05,200
<font color="#ffffff">Whose side are you on anyway?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

76
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,840
<font color="#ffffff">I am on Luang Pho Suea's side.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

77
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:12,440
<font color="#ffffff">He is my benefactor.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

78
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,720
<font color="#ffffff">He saved my life.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

79
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:22,800
<font color="#ffffff">But I understand</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">if you still don't trust me.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

80
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:27,280
<font color="#ffffff">Tell you what,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I'll let you guys contact me instead.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

81
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:37,560
<font color="#ffffff">Here's my card.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

82
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:45,280
<font color="#ffffff">I'll go check with some cops I know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

83
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:07,040
<font color="#ffffff">Can we really trust this reporter?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

84
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:11,800
<font color="#ffffff">Let's give her a chance.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

85
00:08:13,920 --> 00:08:16,840
<font color="#ffffff">I think we'd better get out of here.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">It's not safe.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

86
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:18,040
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

87
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:29,080
<font color="#ffffff">It looks like Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">won't talk easily.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

88
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:31,800
<font color="#ffffff">I expected nothing less.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

89
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:33,720
<font color="#ffffff">That's the fun part.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

90
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:37,880
<font color="#ffffff">What's our next move?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

91
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:40,520
<font color="#ffffff">Aren't you curious</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

92
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:42,520
<font color="#ffffff">to see if pure faith can actually</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

93
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:44,400
<font color="#ffffff">triumph over</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

94
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:47,240
<font color="#ffffff">sin and malice?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

95
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:58,920
<font color="#ffffff">BAN DAO DAP POLICE STATION</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

96
00:09:07,080 --> 00:09:08,520
<font color="#ffffff">Where did you take Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

97
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,440
<font color="#ffffff">What are you on about?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

98
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:13,520
<font color="#ffffff">I asked you,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">where did you take Luang Pho Suea?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

99
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:15,760
<font color="#ffffff">We already let him go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

100
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:18,120
<font color="#ffffff">Why are you still making a scene,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Ms. Reporter?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

101
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:20,080
<font color="#ffffff">It's all a setup!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

102
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:22,680
<font color="#ffffff">You pretended to let him go</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">so you could arrest him again.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

103
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:24,800
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho was captured?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

104
00:09:25,520 --> 00:09:29,400
<font color="#ffffff">Yes. I went to the temple looking for him,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

105
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,160
<font color="#ffffff">but his hut was empty.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

106
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:33,400
<font color="#ffffff">Maybe he already fled.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

107
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:36,760
<font color="#ffffff">Deputy Papon.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

108
00:09:37,920 --> 00:09:39,880
<font color="#ffffff">What makes you think</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

109
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:42,080
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea was captured?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

110
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:45,360
<font color="#ffffff">The room was completely trashed.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

111
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,880
<font color="#ffffff">More importantly,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

112
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,840
<font color="#ffffff">all of his belongings were left behind.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

113
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:53,120
<font color="#ffffff">In that case…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

114
00:09:54,800 --> 00:09:56,560
<font color="#ffffff">Maybe he really was captured.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

115
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:58,960
<font color="#ffffff">I don't believe it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

116
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:01,920
<font color="#ffffff">He probably just got scared and ran away.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

117
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:04,400
<font color="#ffffff">He did nothing wrong!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

118
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:05,800
<font color="#ffffff">Why would he be afraid?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

119
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:11,680
<font color="#ffffff">You seem pretty confident</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in the monk, Ms. Reporter.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

120
00:10:12,560 --> 00:10:15,320
<font color="#ffffff">But fine, just to set your mind at ease.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

121
00:10:16,440 --> 00:10:17,560
<font color="#ffffff">Captain Kan,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

122
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:21,120
<font color="#ffffff">go investigate and see if it's true.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

123
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,280
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

124
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:31,960
<font color="#ffffff">Are you happy now, Ms. Reporter?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

125
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:34,440
<font color="#ffffff">Now stop obstructing police business.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

126
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:45,000
<font color="#ffffff">SUPERINTENDENT CHEEWIN PINRACHAKUL</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

127
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,720
<font color="#ffffff">The monk went missing?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

128
00:10:54,760 --> 00:10:56,000
<font color="#ffffff">Wait a minute!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

129
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:00,760
<font color="#ffffff">What is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

130
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:05,760
<font color="#ffffff">You really have no idea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">that Luang Pho is gone?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

131
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:08,280
<font color="#ffffff">-What do you mean?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Sergeant!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

132
00:11:08,880 --> 00:11:09,760
<font color="#ffffff">Let me handle this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

133
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,200
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant, get in the car.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

134
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:17,800
<font color="#ffffff">I'm glad you did that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

135
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:21,960
<font color="#ffffff">It makes me realize</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you don't know who I really am.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

136
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,400
<font color="#ffffff">About the monk…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

137
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,800
<font color="#ffffff">If he was truly taken…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

138
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:29,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'll find him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

139
00:11:57,520 --> 00:11:59,880
<font color="#ffffff">What? The monk was kidnapped?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

140
00:12:01,680 --> 00:12:03,760
<font color="#ffffff">Do you know which group took him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

141
00:12:04,360 --> 00:12:05,960
<font color="#ffffff">You didn't know about this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

142
00:12:07,560 --> 00:12:10,360
<font color="#ffffff">You think my father</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">would even ask if he knew?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

143
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:14,360
<font color="#ffffff">I thought this was your plan</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to lure Chansuek out.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

144
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:17,800
<font color="#ffffff">Listen, Chief, my father is no fool.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

145
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:22,280
<font color="#ffffff">Abducting him will only bring heat on us.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

146
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:28,320
<font color="#ffffff">Then who is behind this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

147
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:31,480
<font color="#ffffff">Good question. Who is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

148
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:42,840
<font color="#ffffff">Excuse me, ma'am?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

149
00:12:42,920 --> 00:12:44,520
<font color="#ffffff">Yes? What is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

150
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:47,640
<font color="#ffffff">Have you seen anyone</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">with a monk around here?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

151
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:49,000
<font color="#ffffff">A monk?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

152
00:12:49,880 --> 00:12:52,360
<font color="#ffffff">WANTED</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">CONTACT KAMNAN SAWAENG IF SEEN<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

153
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:54,120
<font color="#ffffff">I haven't seen anything.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

154
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:57,200
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, I see. Thank you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

155
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:01,880
<font color="#ffffff">What now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

156
00:13:01,960 --> 00:13:05,640
<font color="#ffffff">She's actually serious about finding him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

157
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:09,000
<font color="#ffffff">We'd better wait and see.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">We need to be sure.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

158
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,360
<font color="#ffffff">How?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

159
00:13:25,160 --> 00:13:27,760
<font color="#ffffff">His belongings are still here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

160
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:32,480
<font color="#ffffff">When was the last time you saw Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

161
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:35,120
<font color="#ffffff">The last time was</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">during the morning chants.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

162
00:13:35,640 --> 00:13:38,160
<font color="#ffffff">But he never came out for lunch.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

163
00:13:39,920 --> 00:13:42,960
<font color="#ffffff">So that means Ya's suspicion</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">was right all along.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

164
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:57,280
<font color="#ffffff">NORTHERN NEWS CENTER</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

165
00:14:03,360 --> 00:14:04,200
<font color="#ffffff">Gosh!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

166
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:07,080
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sorry for startling you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

167
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:09,480
<font color="#ffffff">How did you get in here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

168
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:11,480
<font color="#ffffff">Through the door. Obviously.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

169
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:14,000
<font color="#ffffff">This is trespassing!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

170
00:14:14,760 --> 00:14:18,440
<font color="#ffffff">You told us to get in touch.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">So here we are.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

171
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:21,280
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

172
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:23,520
